    <briefdescription>
<para>Direct Wave-D operability benchmarks for analytics export, serving, distributed retry, and high-cardinality streaming paths. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Replaces proxy-only measurement for analytics operability surfaces with direct module-path benchmarks:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>AO-01 JSON export serialization throughput</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AO-02 CSV export serialization throughput</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AO-03 high-cardinality streaming rejection overhead</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AO-04 distributed retry / recovery latency</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AO-05 serving fail-closed input validation latency </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
